      "WARNING:tensorflow:From C:/home/anonymous/project/Lightweight Analyses/project/Lightweight Analyses\\project\\Lightweight Analyses\\.venv\\Lib\\site-packages\\keras\\src\\backend\\tensorflow\\core.py:232: The name tf.placeholder is deprecated. Please use tf.compat.v1.placeholder instead.\n",
